11. JVM / Design Perspective
Composition → Object references
Aggregation → External object references
Coupling → Compile-time dependency
Cohesion → Logical responsibility grouping

12. Common Tricky Interview Questions (4+ Years)
Q1. Is aggregation a type of association?
✅ Yes

Q2. Which is stronger: aggregation or composition?
✅ Composition

Q3. Can composition exist without aggregation?
❌ No — composition is a form of aggregation

Q4. How does Spring achieve loose coupling?
Interfaces
Dependency Injection
Proxies

Q5. Does inheritance increase coupling?
✅ Yes — inheritance is tightly coupled

13. Interview One-Liners (Use These)
